              },
              "content": "{A想象}姥姥老讲，“万物皆可种”，\n直到看着你种星球，我才晓得是啥子意思。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678048_content",
                "value": "{A想象}姥姥老讲，“万物皆可种”，\n直到看着你种星球，我才晓得是啥子意思。"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 804678048
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678049_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "种作物，你也一点就通，\n{A笑眯眯}还想试试种些些其他的嘛？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678049_content",
                "value": "种作物，你也一点就通，\n{A笑眯眯}还想试试种些些其他的嘛？"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 804678049
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678050_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "这是我从姥姥家带来的竹米，就是<style=Highlight>竹子种子</style>。\n之前嘛，没有适合的地方我一直没舍得种，\n{A委屈}虽然竹子很好种活……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678050_content",
                "value": "这是我从姥姥家带来的竹米，就是<style=Highlight>竹子种子</style>。\n之前嘛，没有适合的地方我一直没舍得种，\n{A委屈}虽然竹子很好种活……"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 804678050
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678051_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "但只有活不下去的时候才会开花留下种子，\n所以，我想把它们种在最好的地方，\n遇到你的星球，终于能种下了~！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678051_content",
                "value": "但只有活不下去的时候才会开花留下种子，\n所以，我想把它们种在最好的地方，\n遇到你的星球，终于能种下了~！"
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 804678051
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_709301_804678052_fakeName",
                "value": null
              },
              "content": "{A期待}你要拿起种种看嘛？\n长大的竹子能用来制作家具、工具，\n还有竹笋，炒炒特别好吃。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
